::scene TITLE

EVENT FADE_IN

TITLE arrears_logo

3s

::scene COLD OPEN

CAM 1 WIDE

NPC npc_arrears_gil
NPC npc_arrears_dot
NPC npc_arrears_nan

Gil Haddow:
He's coming at four.

Dot Haddow:
Then she's your mother till five.

ACTION npc_arrears_nan sips her tea.

Nan:
Mother's extra.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 2 CLOSEUP on Gil

ACTION npc_arrears_gil rubs his face.

Gil Haddow:
You pay thirty a week for that chair.

Nan:
And it's a good chair. I'm not being your mother for free.

Dot Haddow:
Five credits. One hour. You call him Gilbert.

Nan:
Ten.

ACTION npc_arrears_dot folds her arms.

Dot Haddow:
Seven.

Nan:
Done.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene THE INSPECTION

CAM 3 MEDIUM on Prosser

NPC npc_arrears_prosser
ACTION npc_arrears_prosser enters the frame.

Mr Prosser:
Afternoon. Annual inspection. Don't get up.

ACTION npc_arrears_prosser looks around the room.

Mr Prosser:
Window's still in. Good.

ACTION npc_arrears_prosser writes on his clipboard.

CAM 1 WIDE

Mr Prosser:
And who's this?

Gil Haddow:
My mother.

Nan:
Hello, Gilbert.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 3 MEDIUM on Prosser

ACTION npc_arrears_prosser reads his clipboard.

Mr Prosser:
It says here your mother's dead.

Dot Haddow:
She got better.

Nan:
Halcyon. It was on offer.

EVENT LAUGHTER

Mr Prosser:
Then she's a new adult in the unit. That's forty a week on the rent.

CAM 2 CLOSEUP on Gil

ACTION npc_arrears_gil slaps his knee.

Gil Haddow:
She's family. Family's free.

Mr Prosser:
Family's forty.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene THE CHAIR

CAM 1 WIDE

ACTION npc_arrears_nan points at Gil.

Nan:
I'm not paying forty for this chair.

ACTION npc_arrears_prosser leans in.

Mr Prosser:
Paying for the chair?

Dot Haddow:
She means it figuratively.

Mr Prosser:
What's she paying now?

ACTION npc_arrears_dot stares at Nan.

Dot Haddow:
Nothing.

Nan:
Thirty.

EVENT LAUGHTER

ACTION npc_arrears_prosser writes on his clipboard.

Mr Prosser:
Subletting. That's a breach.

ACTION npc_arrears_gil sighs.

Gil Haddow:
How much is a breach?

Mr Prosser:
Let me see. Forty for the adult, plus a cut of the thirty, plus I don't like your tone.

Gil Haddow:
I haven't got a tone.

Mr Prosser:
Sixty.

EVENT LAUGHTER

::scene TAG

CAM 3 MEDIUM on Prosser

ACTION npc_arrears_prosser looks at the armchair.

Mr Prosser:
Is the chair free after five?

CAM 2 CLOSEUP on Nan

Nan:
Twenty-five to you. Thirty if you want me to call you Gilbert.

ACTION npc_arrears_dot laughs.

EVENT LAUGHTER

CAM 1 WIDE

ACTION npc_arrears_gil looks into the camera.

Gil Haddow:
I want to move.

EVENT APPLAUSE

CREDITS 12
ARREARS

Taped in front of a live studio audience
at KSAB-TV, Coldwater
END_CREDITS

EVENT FADE_OUT

END
